phrase: build histogram until frequency ceiling {max_freq}
slot: max_freq int
test: list=1,2,1,3,1,4 max_freq=3
expect: => i=1 r=0.0 ok=true s="stopped at item: 1" errors=0 n=6 res=[1,2,1,3,1,4] cache=0 hits=0
expect: => map={1:3,2:1,3:1}
